# Sv32 global-mapping targeted-fence smoke test.
# Host setup preloads:
# - x1 = translated virtual address
# - x2 = satp for ASID 1
# - x3 = satp for ASID 2
# - x4 = physical leaf-PTE address shared by both address spaces
# - x5 = target ASID for the selective sfence.vma
# - x6 = mstatus with MPRV and MPP=Supervisor
# - x7 = mstatus with only MPP=Supervisor
# - x8 = replacement non-global leaf PTE mapping to value B
# Expect x10 = A, x11 = A after ASID-specific sfence.vma, and x12 = B after full sfence.vma.
# Trailing nops leave safe speculative fetch space for the pipeline core.
